{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobbZkpCz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はばタンとﾊﾙｻﾝ 。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸公演で、机に5羽ほどちょこんと置いてあったこちらの黄色い鳥さん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "兵庫県のマスコットキャラクター「はばタン」という、不死鳥をイメージした鳥だそうです💛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてこの日の私の髪の毛は、\n「カチモリヘアー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「カチモリヘアー」とは、\nその姿が鳥の尾に似ていることから、\n韓国語でカササギ（鳥）を意味する「カチ」\nと「髪・頭」を意味する「モリ」を合わせた言葉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つまり、鳥と鳥のコラボですね🐤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はばタンの力、Buddiesの皆さんの声援で、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "羽を大きく広げるように、全身を思いっきり使い、ライブを楽しむことができました！🐥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobBInNLX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとう\n静岡公演もまた写真載せますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つづいて、"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob0ZL8zJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobbkfQQ8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8月の太陽はてりてりだったあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8/1は、\n「OSAKA GIGANTIC MUSIC FESTIVAL 2026」に出演させていただきました〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じ青空の下で、\nBuddiesの方、そして櫻坂46を初めて見るという方も一緒に盛り上がってくださって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8月、1日目から素敵な時間を過ごせました❤️‍🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと空から眺めてた鳥さんも羨ましかったと思います🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobRL9z3Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全身はこんな感じ☀︎💚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☁️☁️☁️\n急ですが、\nこのブログを書いてる今、私は空の上を羽ばたいています〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高くて、\n気持ちいいーー⤴️⤴️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と言いたいところですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、あまり高いところが得意ではないんですよね..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「そこ曲がったら、櫻坂？」のロケで、FUJIYAMAに乗ったときも、割とへっちゃら？だったように、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジェットコースターはある程度いけるので、よく驚かれます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジェットコースターのような、一瞬で高低差が変わるものは大丈夫🙆‍♀️\nむしろ時々あのスリルを求めてしまいます😎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一方で、\n観覧車とか\n展望台で床が透明なところを歩くとか、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じっくり高いところにいるのが苦手で、\n自ら進んでは行かないです🥲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なので、万が一、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に観覧車に乗ることになっても、\n絶対に揺らさないでくださいね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "怒ります😄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「急」つづきですが、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "〜似ているようで、自分の中では明確に分かれている好き嫌い特集〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・奇妙系のお話は苦手"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミステリー、サスペンスは大好き。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・エビフライは苦手"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エビ天は大好き。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・夜にパスタは苦手"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど昼なら嬉しい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思いつくだけ書いてみました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんも、こーゆー絶妙な好き嫌いありますか？\n考えて、誰かと共有し合うのも\n移動時間や待ち時間の良い暇つぶしになるかもしれません🪄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで今回はこの辺で終わろうと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍁🍁🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このブログがupされる頃は、\nもう広島公演初日！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん気をつけてお越しください！\nそして外でも室内でもこまめに水分補給して、\n暑さ対策してくださいね〜〜🚿🥺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob1h2net.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブの「あつさ」には覚悟しててください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "瀬戸内の太陽にも負けないくらい、あつい2日間にしましょ〜☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#47"}], "source": "official"}